message: >-
  This is a student-led research project. The companion paper is in preparation;
  its title and author list are NOT final. Please contact the authors before citing.
title: "priya-forecast: symbolic distillation of the PRIYA Lyman-alpha P1D emulator (student project)"
abstract: >-
  Student research project led by Aidan Behmer. Distills the PRIYA multi-fidelity
  Gaussian-process emulator of the Lyman-alpha 1D flux power spectrum into per-parameter
  symbolic equations via PySR, and scores their derivative faithfulness (the parameter
  slope a Fisher forecast depends on), with a Sobolev derivative-matching loss to repair
  unfaithful slopes.
